### Notifications endpoints

@baseUrl = https://backend-cleaner-nestjs.onrender.com/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Lister mes notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJlNDg3YjVjYy0xZGY0LTQ2NTAtYTFmNy1hNzk5ODU5YmUyMjEiLCJlbWFpbCI6Imxvb25hNzc1N0BnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJwaG9uZSI6IisyMzc2OTg3NjU0MzIiLCJyb2xlIjoiQ0lUSVpFTiIsImlhdCI6MTc3NTIxMjY4NCwiZXhwIjoxNzc3MDI3MDg0fQ.VIoEh40HkUevq0CviGCegpbs_XmhDKRXnKZYxqMhv4Q

